SUMMARY:11th World Congress of Asian Psychiatry (WCAP 2026)
DESCRIPTION:The 11th World Congress of Asian Psychiatry is organized by t
 he Asian Federation of Psychiatric Associations in partnership with the 
 World Psychiatric Association at Hokkaido University under the theme Har
 monization between Urbanization and Nature in Future Mental Health. The 
 programme includes keynote lectures\, symposia\, workshops and oral and 
 poster presentations.\n\nDeadlines\nSymposium and workshop proposal subm
 ission opens: 2025-11-05\nSymposium and workshop proposal submission: 20
 26-02-28\nAbstract submission opens: 2025-12-25\nOral abstract submissio
 n: 2026-04-06\nPoster abstract submission: 2026-04-30\nPresenter registr
 ation: 2026-07-31\nEarly registration: 2026-08-16\nRegular registration:
  2026-09-15\n\nhttps://www.wcap2026.jp/
LOCATION:Sapporo\, Hokkaido\, JP\, Hokkaido University\, Clark Memorial S
 tudent Center
URL:https://www.wcap2026.jp/
